For one day:
$$
5 \text{ hours} \times 6 \text{ dollars/hour} = 30 \text{ dollars}
$$

For two days:
$$
30 \text{ dollars/day} \times 2 \text{ days} = 60 \text{ dollars}
$$

Thus, Victor made $\boxed{60}$ dollars in those two days. 

