   Nancy started with 80 files and deleted 31.  
   $ 80 - 31 = 49 $ files remaining.

2. **Determine how many folders are needed:**  
   She puts these 49 files into folders with 7 files per folder.  
   $ 49 \div 7 = 7 $.

Thus, Nancy ends up with $\boxed{7}$ folders.  
