Then, in the next level, she gains 39 more lives. So now, I need to add 39 to the 35 she had after losing lives. Let me do that addition. 35 plus 39. Let me think, 35 plus 30 is 65, and then plus 9 more is 74. So, 35 + 39 equals 74. 

